  clientName: Clark
  jobDescription: Connect the factory access road across the 80-meter channel. Keep
    the SUV's lane closer to one side to work around the existing equipment, and
    carry it safely to the opposite bank. Review why an off-center load can create
    torsion in a real bridge.
